      ],
      "blockMap": {
        "3bLNTbyqcw41": {
          "id": "3bLNTbyqcw41",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "color": "light_text_primary",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "临危受命，她很快振作起来，不仅在短短十年间建设起繁荣的武陵城，她本人也在摸索中成为了一名尽职尽责的领袖。但十年前的灾难仍是悬在众人头顶的一把剑，时刻提醒着她，武陵城的安居乐业可能会转瞬即逝。"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "A2oRzlEGB3pW": {
          "id": "A2oRzlEGB3pW",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "color": "light_text_primary",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "干员庄方宜，武陵科学发展区管代，息壤新材项目负责天师。经宏科院推荐加入终末地，进行裂隙相关的研究。"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "CprXZFkUsWyT": {
          "id": "CprXZFkUsWyT",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "color": "light_text_primary",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "庄方宜出身宏山，自幼便展现出非凡天赋，未成年就以优异成绩进入天师府学院。其后因才能卓越被选拔加入息壤项目，成为武陵科考站最年轻的成员。一场灾难中，科考站几乎全军覆没，资历最浅的她被推上台前，担任管代职位，背负起整个武陵。"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "Dxpa5whVhGFD": {
          "id": "Dxpa5whVhGFD",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "color": "light_text_primary",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "“人还在，那就什么都在。”"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "YGe6hTNiVKr7": {
          "id": "YGe6hTNiVKr7",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "color": "light_text_primary",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "“能咬牙坚持下来，就不算输。”"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "authorMap": {},
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "sourcePattern": "text_only"
  },
  "detailLoaded": true
